        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"c99ac3b9-e4eb-4871-9980-4ed298cac2c9\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app ever, they are making every thing to work on premium only,Now this app is like that type of games where you have to purchase the full version of game after installing it for free 😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"ed1a745c-4541-45e7-bdf7-bf1d7484e1c3\",\"review_text\":\"Good app 👍 most recommended for listening music (with premium)\"},{\"review_id\":\"b3614213-69c4-4f66-be15-3a0283852a4b\",\"review_text\":\"Removed most basic features like play back and queue hating it now\"},{\"review_id\":\"5fc439ed-b120-44f5-9f99-1d9c0fb99ded\",\"review_text\":\"5 star\"},{\"review_id\":\"839cc9ad-7f44-4942-b593-26c17eed2685\",\"review_text\":\"From my experience it is the best app to ever exist i use it every day at it is DEFINITELY worth every little penny and if you do, you will be in straight up heaven i dont have anything bad or negative to say about this app, it is sent from above, my little angel app\"},{\"review_id\":\"5fabce90-9bb2-41ca-a8d9-084ad25610a0\",\"review_text\":\"I started using spotify after watching advertisement but totally disappointed after using the app, the progress bar is not working i tried alot to move progress bar to listen the song again but had to search the song again to play it again. SoundCloud is better in operation than this one frustrating\"},{\"review_id\":\"1c386c89-7b0d-4765-bf2f-fb779ab0ea84\",\"review_text\":\"I like it .. bcoz it has lyrics on it .\"},{\"review_id\":\"ec6ccb76-7cc8-41a9-85d4-2245add5cf40\",\"review_text\":\"Bestt\"},{\"review_id\":\"a2e78f08-0fb9-4ee3-ba29-d301fc098386\",\"review_text\":\"Updated version is very bad. Bcoz after palying song can't forward or last played song can't play..\"},{\"review_id\":\"e7981954-1447-4700-a6a3-18915a008e45\",\"review_text\":\"Kanjoos\"}]}"
